														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-565798">
									

<p>They seem different enough. SCP-688 is for an unknown purpose and has an unknown amount of power. It is currently Euclid because it seems unlikely to destroy the world on its own. This one just seems to represent time. It only flows one way, and making it flow the other just rewinds time to before it was flipped.</p>
<p>Plus, this is a controlled effect. Keep it with you. If something goes wrong in a split-second, rewind time to fix. This much more horrifying in useable power, as it is unlikely to kill you.</p>

							</div>

								
					
